.DATA
VT@Node: NOP
.CODE
lbl_builder@Node: 
LOADFP; apilar valor de FP
LOADSP; apilar valor de SP
STOREFP; almacenar FP en el tope de la pila
LOAD 4
LOAD 3
SWAP
STOREREF 1
PUSH0; valor null
LOAD 3
SWAP
STOREREF 2
PUSH0; valor null
LOAD 3
SWAP
STOREREF 3
STOREFP; restaurar FP
RET 2



